  "transcriber_notes": [
   "Rows: 6 year rows + 9 州廳 rows (incl. 據置、行賞其ノ他) + 11 occupation rows = 26 as printed. Column heading '前欄中' (of the foregoing) is written '內'. The 年度 label is printed 年度末 as small type above the year numerals. There is no separate 總數 row; the 昭和13年度末 row is the total.",
   "The 昭和13年度末 row is printed in a heavy, smudged italic. Averages there are unreadable: cols '貯金現在 — 平均一人金額' (reads like 38.49 or 98.49 / 88.49), '本島人 — 平均一人金額' (13.56 or 18.56) and '高砂族 — 平均一人金額' (14.98, last digits uncertain) are '[?]' — not a 3-vs-8 case settled by a printed total. Their 人員/金額 cells read clearly enough and the column sums reconcile (see below). 高砂族 平均一人金額 [?]: amount/persons would give about 14.88, but that is not used.",
   "Total check (人員 and 金額 columns, all three groups): 州廳 rows sum to the 13年度末 row in every column except 貯金現在 金額 (parts fall short by 1: 34,838,743 vs 34,838,744). Occupation rows: all columns reconcile except 貯金現在 金額 (parts short by 11).",
   "Printed averages that differ from amount/persons (as printed, not corrected): 雜業 高砂族 43.92 (computed 43.82); 使役人 貯金現在 46.16 (computed 45.99). Re-read once on an enlarged crop.",
   "Occupation labels read (letter-spaced, stacked): 農業, 商業, 工業, 雜業, 使役人, 官公吏、軍人, 學生、生徒, 漁撈業及船夫, 無業, 團體, 不詳. 澎湖 and 無業 高砂族 cells are '…'."
  ],
